{"schema_version":"1.0","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa2/","title":"금연침 AA2","language":"ko-KR","description":"경외기혈 금연침의 위치·취혈·자침 정보를 정리합니다.","text":"금연침 AA2\n분류\n이침 · 코드 AA2\n위치\n금연침: 이신문, 인후, 내비, 내분비, 폐1, 폐2\n취혈\n자침·주의\n임상 연결\n경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","sections":[{"title":"분류","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa2/#_1","text":"이침 · 코드 AA2","links":[]},{"title":"위치","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa2/#_2","text":"금연침: 이신문, 인후, 내비, 내분비, 폐1, 폐2","links":[]},{"title":"취혈","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa2/#_3","text":"","links":[]},{"title":"자침·주의","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa2/#_4","text":"","links":[]},{"title":"임상 연결","level":2,"url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa2/#_5","text":"경외기혈은 관련 부위·증상과 14경맥의 경혈을 함께 보고 배혈합니다.\n→ 경외기혈 통합 목록","links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"]}],"headings":[{"level":2,"title":"분류","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa2/#_1"},{"level":2,"title":"위치","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa2/#_2"},{"level":2,"title":"취혈","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa2/#_3"},{"level":2,"title":"자침·주의","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa2/#_4"},{"level":2,"title":"임상 연결","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa2/#_5"}],"links":["https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupoint-network/extra-points/"],"related_reading":[],"interpretation":"Public article text and navigation only; links do not establish clinical equivalence or treatment recommendations.","provenance":{"document_id":"MSA-3670B51F1F2F8DA3","url":"https://wiki.minseong.co.kr/acupuncture/extra-points/aa2/","text_sha256":"2aeaa9f0efa9e162109a987db09add096a1c21da3dd1d832f1536d71d8291e40","source_sha256":"c98d5455d1